    "content": "<p>Get a behind-the-scenes look at the development of War Robots: Frontiers in this announcement trailer!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This video will give you the lowdown on Frontiers straight from Zukata, the game&rsquo;s Creative Director. Learn about the game mechanics, how to customize your Robot to fit your playstyle, tactically use your environment, and lots more you&rsquo;ll need to know before you jump into War Robots: Frontiers!</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=66ra_r9lbuU\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/66ra_r9lbuU?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=Fiti5\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nSubscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube channel</a> and stay tuned for more War Robots: Frontiers videos!</p>",
